  "structure": {
    "block_count": 14,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Expecting a June baby? Congratulations! Here are five fascinating facts about June birthdays.",
        "text_sha256": "a8d14bfd241a90c5a4c2c003c86801253733c3966fd9e36e923cea0ba8290455",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pregnant with a June baby? How lucky are you? Here's all the fun you can expect from having a baby born in June.",
        "text_sha256": "6d5c0ddb6b302417798196f4a26c6bd6e4db689c39d3dc6eca2d28739cda8938",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "June babies have natural charm. They're born under the zodiac sign of Gemini — known for its quick-witted curiosity — or Cancer, famous for its big-hearted kindness.",
        "text_sha256": "fc819d2091f12badab0e546c48b45ef57bb0bfa772bdd75466c0a943b79eb1bd",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "June birthdays are VIPs. Your little one might be born on the same day as an Academy Award winner or a rock star.",
        "text_sha256": "ea931b0ccce00d24d19691ca5bbf9d1c73294f85ae254db18d8469cc1ca92576",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Their star power is off the charts. You can have fun exploring your June baby's astrological traits with our free Birth Chart Calculator .",
        "text_sha256": "6911ac77d4460ad811551a80697bd11dee019e75e88d011612113533f854bc85",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "June's birthstone is a pearl, which symbolizes purity and innocence. In some cultures, pearls also represent a long life and prosperity.",
        "text_sha256": "b7dd84175a1ba1f6b734617f195914d58c9a3a0f09f0b950a04a77a3cd6c0b3e",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Babies born in June are either Gemini ( May 21 - June 20 ) or Cancer ( June 21 - July 22 ). Geminis are smart and super curious. Cancers are nurturing and sensitive.",
        "text_sha256": "b52d2bdae5fa7a71b8753e42d7854cb389e7bcf6c5d40ec8ee3b9d4f7fe49bd4",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your little star might share a birthday with Morgan Freeman ( June 1 ), Angelina Jolie ( June 4 ), Liam Neeson ( June 7 ), Neil Patrick Harris ( June 15 ), Paul McCartney ( June 18 ), Chris Pratt ( June 21 ), or Meryl Streep ( June 22 ).",
        "text_sha256": "ac495c32c561f1e35a73aef9ea6a2858ad15eddace73b78698e4eabe4afdf203",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your June baby might be born on the first Friday in June , which is National Donut Day, or on June 15 — aka Smile Power Day. She could also be born on Father's Day (the third Sunday in June) or National Selfie Day ( June 21 ). If she arrives on June 3 , she'll blow out her candles each year on World Bicycle Day. Or, your June child might arrive close to a personal milestone. \"My due date is 6/6 and my birthday is 6/12,\" shared What to Expect Community member h911. \"It's kind of wild to think about possibly giving birth on or near my birthday. Talk about a gift!\"",
        "text_sha256": "5acefaeb53fb5aab3742bc762096ee31ca4e08d4899d24e6fc0c72bd00d2c4b1",
        "word_count": 113
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "You can have fun exploring the astrological traits of your June baby with our free Birth Chart Calculator .",
        "text_sha256": "92896987159705889a73d4dbc08dda2834aa79f3acec5bc7d1f7b84a7f34f231",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Find more personalized info about your June baby in our free What to Expect app .",
        "text_sha256": "dd6d07df7625a09e35ee873982be8ed6fad141236592bd09b78dc3d3299b9d12",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "See all June due dates",
        "text_sha256": "e8a47acfc34850dafcbd7f85a6cfdb96031496aeabdb338e56a7a3ec61d9cc11",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "June 1 | June 2 | June 3 June 4 | June 5 | June 6 June 7 | June 8 | June 9 June 10 | June 11 | June 12 June 13 | June 14 | June 15 June 16 | June 17 | June 18 June 19 | June 20 | June 21 June 22 | June 23 | June 24 June 25 | June 26 | June 27 June 28 | June 29 | June 30",
        "text_sha256": "3c5333352a66ba183c189beff6c994ebbe9307372d4daf01b5dd303cd80f96b6",
        "word_count": 80
      }
    ],
